WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.075
Today we will present performance work as a team. Our work connects with our own

00:00:05.075 --> 00:00:05.725
local community.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:09.648
Agree on the order of songs, dance or drama items.

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:13.541
Rehearse entry, performance and respectful exit.

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:17.328
Present the item and thank the audience at the end.
